# ============================================================================
# Conventional Commits Format (German/English hybrid for team)
# ============================================================================
#
# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
#
# [optional body]
#
# [optional footer(s)]
#
# ============================================================================
# Types (use lowercase):
# ============================================================================
#
# feat     - Neue Feature (feature)
# fix      - Bug Fix
# docs     - Dokumentation Änderungen
# style    - Code Style (whitespace, formatting, etc. - no code change)
# refactor - Code Refactoring (keine neue Features/Bugfixes)
# perf     - Performance Verbesserung
# test     - Tests hinzufügen/ändern
# build    - Build-System, CI/CD Änderungen
# ci       - Continuous Integration Änderungen
# chore    - Wartungsarbeiten (maintenance)
# revert   - Änderung zurücksetzen (undo previous commit)
#
# ============================================================================
# Scopes (bewährte Werte):
# ============================================================================
#
# api       - API Server Änderungen
# web       - Frontend/Voiceflow Änderungen
# db        - Datenbank/Drizzle Schema
# auth      - Authentifizierung (Clerk)
# voice     - Voice/VAPI/Telnyx Integration
# billing   - Stripe Zahlungen
# ui        - UI Komponenten
# types     - TypeScript Typen/Zod Schemas
#
# ============================================================================
# Beispiele:
# ============================================================================
#
# feat(api): add voice recording endpoint with consent validation
# fix(web): resolve sidebar navigation active state bug
# docs: update README with environment setup instructions
# refactor(db): optimize organizations table indexing
# feat(voice): implement OpenAI TTS fallback for VAPI outages
#
# ============================================================================